@startuml
title Governance - Invocation Lifecycle
hide empty description
[*] --> CREATED_DOC
CREATED_DOC --> STARTED : CALL_STARTED
STARTED --> SUCCEEDED : CALL_SUCCEEDED
STARTED --> FAILED : CALL_FAILED
STARTED --> REJECTED : provider rejects
STARTED --> TIMED_OUT : provider timeout
STARTED --> RETRYING_DOC : provider retry event
RETRYING_DOC --> STARTED : next attempt
FAILED --> FALLBACK : fallback configured
REJECTED --> FALLBACK : fallback configured
TIMED_OUT --> FALLBACK : fallback configured
FALLBACK --> FALLBACK_SUCCESS_DOC : fallback returns
FALLBACK --> FALLBACK_FAILED : FALLBACK_FAILED
SUCCEEDED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*] : no fallback
REJECTED --> [*] : no fallback
TIMED_OUT --> [*] : no fallback
FALLBACK_SUCCESS_DOC --> [*]
FALLBACK_FAILED --> [*]

state "CREATED [DOC MODEL]" as CREATED_DOC
state "RETRYING [DOC MODEL]\nrelated event: CALL_RETRIED" as RETRYING_DOC
state "FALLBACK_SUCCESS [DOC MODEL]\nno dedicated GovernanceEventType" as FALLBACK_SUCCESS_DOC

note right
GovernanceEventType 还包含规则加载与 CircuitBreaker 事件。
CircuitBreaker CLOSED/OPEN/HALF_OPEN 由 Resilience4j 实例管理，
不是 Governance Core 的持久状态。
end note
@enduml
